  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 9 December 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nLooking for the ultimate gift for your family this year? 23 Elliston Crescent is ready to deliver the easy-breezy Stanmore Bay lifestyle right to your doorstep.\r\n\r\nPicture this: December 25th, the sun is shining, the ocean breeze is rolling in, and you’re hosting Christmas lunch on the deck, taking in the view with a cold drink in hand while the family relaxes. Living here means summer isn't just a season it's your everyday routine. Take a short stroll down to the beach for a morning paddle, kick back in the afternoon, and soak up everything this vibrant coastal community has to offer.\r\n\r\nWhy You'll Love It:\r\n\r\n• Lovely Outlook & Views: Kick back on the deck and take in the view it’s the perfect backdrop for morning coffees and summer evening BBQs.\r\n\r\n• Move-In Ready Comfort: Super tidy and completely comfortable to live in and enjoy right now no stress, just pack your bags and move straight in before the holidays!\r\n\r\n• Value-Add Potential: Got an eye for design? It’s the perfect blank canvas to add your own personal flair, refresh the interiors and make it your own. \r\n\r\n• The Perfect First Home: An affordable, accessible entry-level ticket into one of the Coast's most desirable suburbs.\r\n\r\nWhether you're stepping onto the property ladder, searching for a relaxed beachside vibe with a view, or hunting for a property with great bones and upside, 23 Elliston Crescent checks every box.\r\n\r\nDon't wait for Santa, make your move now and celebrate the New Year in your new home!\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
